; CONTROL for LE-12 (not a defect): mutual tail recursion between procedures of
; DIFFERENT ARITY is already O(1) on the VM. OP_TAIL_CALL slides `argc` slots
; onto the current frame and jumps, with no arity comparison anywhere, so the
; shape LLVM `musttail` cannot express at all costs the VM nothing.
; vm-src : ok, 20000100000 at 200,000 hops
; native : ok (ESH-0102c, via the tail-transfer dispatcher)
(define (aping n acc) (if (= n 0) acc (apong (- n 1) (+ acc n) 0)))
(define (apong n acc k) (if (= n 0) acc (aping (- n 1) (+ acc n))))
(display (aping 200000 0))
(newline)
